These chip footprints are excerpted from the KiCad official footprint
library (https://gitlab.com/kicad/libraries/kicad-footprints) and are
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC-BY-SA 4.0).
No 3D model is vendored: each footprint names KiCad's own model by its
library path (`${KICAD10_3DMODEL_DIR}/...`), as the KiCad library does, and
KiCad's installed 3dmodels directory supplies it.
